    <briefdescription>
<para>CUDA operation wrapper with move semantics and use-after-move detection. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="version"><para>0.1.0 </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Maturity: 🟡 BETA </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Gap Categories: CWE-672 (use-after-free), CWE-457 (uninitialized variable)</para>
</simplesect>
Provides:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Stateful CUDA operation management</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Move semantics for device-side operations</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Use-after-move prevention with noexcept guarantees</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Stream-based asynchronous operation tracking</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para>ThemisDB Remediation Roadmap: Sprint 8 Phase 1C </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
